@SchoolDonation.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5248
GET http://localhost:5248/api/Schools
Accept: application/json

###
@host = http://localhost:5248

### 1. Register a Secure Manager
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/Register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Secure",
  "lastName": "Manager",
  "email": "secure22@admin.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "phoneNumber": "099999999",
  "userRole": "Manager"
}
### 1. Get Dashboard Numbers (Top Cards)
GET {{host}}/api/Home/Statistics
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Project Cards (The List)
GET {{host}}/api/Home/LatestProjects
Accept: application/json